dance Shapeshifter
// The bass pushes the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the hi-hats set how fast it spins and the
// middle turns it; drops in the bass reverse it.
// Inspired by mutator, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.bass  speed 3.22  settle 0.02
zoom follows music.mid_hit  amount 0.5  settle 10.8
spin follows music.high_hit  from 115 to 229  smooth 0.15
turn on music.mid changes  by 0.61
reverse on music.bass drops  by 0.66  on 12 off 4
